      {
        h.observedWhere "controls-refused" "zenoh_grants_check" { h.count "negativeControlsRefused" 77; } "The checker refuses exactly 77 corruptions before it checks anything generated. They are 42 records through the decoder, 10 weakened contracts and 4 contracts with an exclusive upper bound. They also include 2 drifted constants. The last 19 are binding files that differ from the rendered text by one edit. Four of those are read from disk as bytes. A dropped or invented control changes the count and re-admits the item.";
