    -- legacy 01a1af02-029f-7e62-a3b4-91b37d965b84 (done): Plan the Zenoh service limits record and the sizes it checks
    -- The Zenoh service sizes its core with constants of its own, two holders and two rows, and the core
    -- refuses any table of another size. The grants record declares six limits, and the generation carries
    -- none of them. This item plans a limits record that the generation carries and the root serves. The
